          "expression": "$.externalReferences[?(@.properties[?(@.name=='pkic:profile:context' && @.value=='roadmap')])]",
          "nativeName": "pqc-migration#R2 roadmap",
          "relevance": "recommended",
          "rationale": "The supplier's own roadmap for post-quantum capability. The record states each purpose's capability as a status and a blocker, never a date (decision 0007). A roadmap is where a supplier may name target releases and dependencies; the record points to it and does not evaluate it. A per-purpose roadma"
        }
